Super K3D is a version of K3D that never came to be.
This project aims to restore the glory of K3D by introducing a new workflow, featuring:
- A new procedural approach
- New techniques for traditional modeling
- A new rendering engine
- A versatile rendering engine suitable for various types of projects
- A new renderer for toon-style visuals (similar to Eevee)
- A new interface designed for this new workflow
- And more

